<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Inscrição Realizada com Sucesso!</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #ffb7d5, #ff85c2 35%, #a855f7 100%);
    }

    /* PARTÍCULAS */
    .particle {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: white;
      animation: float linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      from {
        transform: translateY(100vh);
      }
      to {
        transform: translateY(-100px);
      }
    }

    /* CARD */
    .card {
      position: relative;
      width: 650px;
      max-width: 92%;
      padding: 40px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .12);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .2);
      border-radius: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, .18);
      animation: entrada 1s ease;
    }

    @keyframes entrada {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(50px) scale(.9);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
      }
    }

    /* BAILARINA */
    .ballet {
      position: relative;
      width: 140px;
      height: 180px;
      margin: 0 auto 15px auto;
      animation: dance 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes dance {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: rotate(-6deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: rotate(6deg);
      }
    }

    .head {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ffd8be;
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      top: 5px;
    }

    .hair {
      width: 45px;
      height: 45px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #4a2d1a;
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      top: 0;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .body-ballet {
      width: 25px;
      height: 55px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 15px;
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      top: 40px;
    }

    .skirt {
      width: 90px;
      height: 50px;
      background: #ffc3df;
      clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      top: 80px;
    }

    .arm {
      width: 60px;
      height: 8px;
      background: #ffd8be;
      border-radius: 10px;
      position: absolute;
      top: 60px;
    }

    .arm.left {
      left: 10px;
      transform-origin: right center;
      animation: leftArm 2s infinite alternate;
    }

    .arm.right {
      right: 10px;
      transform-origin: left center;
      animation: rightArm 2s infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes leftArm {
      from { transform: rotate(-25deg); }
      to { transform: rotate(25deg); }
    }

    @keyframes rightArm {
      from { transform: rotate(25deg); }
      to { transform: rotate(-25deg); }
    }

    .leg {
      width: 8px;
      height: 70px;
      background: #ffd8be;
      border-radius: 10px;
      position: absolute;
      top: 120px;
    }

    .leg.left {
      left: 60px;
    }

    .leg.right {
      left: 75px;
    }

    /* CHECK */
    .check {
      width: 110px;
      height: 110px;
      margin: 10px auto 25px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #22c55e;
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 60px;
      font-weight: bold;
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(34, 197, 94, .7);
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: scale(1);
      }
      50% {
        transform: scale(1.08);
      }
    }

    /* TEXTO */
    h1 {
      color: white;
      font-size: 38px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    p {
      color: white;
      opacity: .95;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    /* MOBILE */
    @media(max-width:768px) {
      body {
        padding: 15px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 35px 20px;
      }

      .ballet {
        transform: scale(.9);
        margin-bottom: 5px;
      }

      .check {
        width: 90px;
        height: 90px;
        font-size: 45px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 16px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div id="particles"></div>

  <div class="card">

    <div class="ballet">
      <div class="hair"></div>
      <div class="head"></div>

      <div class="arm left"></div>
      <div class="arm right"></div>

      <div class="body-ballet"></div>
      <div class="skirt"></div>

      <div class="leg left"></div>
      <div class="leg right"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="check">✓</div>

    <h1>Inscrição Realizada!</h1>

    <p>
      O cadastro na <strong>fila de espera</strong> foi concluído com sucesso. Assim que uma vaga compatível com a idade da sua bailarina for liberada, entraremos em contato pelo WhatsApp!
    </p>

  </div>

  <script>
    // Gerador de partículas mágicas de fundo
    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i++) {
      const p = document.createElement('div');
      p.classList.add('particle');
      const size = Math.random() * 5 + 2;

      p.style.width = size + 'px';
      p.style.height = size + 'px';
      p.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
      p.style.opacity = Math.random();
      p.style.animationDuration = (Math.random() * 8 + 5) + 's';

      document.body.appendChild(p);
    }
  </script>

</body>

</html>